  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "Freeze the `phone record search` / `phone record read` answers as the P19 bounded phone-tool envelope with scope bot.",
    "Freeze the caller rule: the host resolves the caller from the claimed DSH session carried out-of-band by the shell, never from --session or any argv word.",
    "Freeze that a compaction replace checkpoint keeps its shadowed session lines readable, and that reading either side exposes the range/reference relation.",
    "Freeze the P25 erased-payload answer: reading a record://event reference whose payload the host erased returns ok:false with code record_erased and never the original bytes; search skips it.",
    "Freeze the S6 step-2 session answer: a record://session reference whose line was replaced by a tombstone returns the same ok:false record_erased shape and message; reading nearby surviving lines never reconstructs the erased one."
  ],
